# Every tracked file in this repository is text, so normalise line endings on
# the way into the index and check LF out on every platform. Windows is a
# supported build host (docs/build/windows.md), and without this the CRLF that
# already reached kernels/ and three .rs files would come back the next time one
# of them is edited there.
#
# The kernel sources matter more than the rest: they are embedded with
# include_str! and hashed into the compiled-kernel cache key, so a line-ending
# flip invalidates every cached binary on every machine.
* text=auto eol=lf
